 净重；目标2J≤35元/斤、3J≤45元/斤，3J≤30元/斤为好价
 参考。节前可能反弹。\n参考资料：\nhttps://sh.people.com.cn/
 n2/2026/1119/c176737-41755476.html\nhttps://paper.xinmin.cn/html/xmwb/2026
 -11-12/5/252021.html
